### MaterialRates — CREATE (expects 201 Created; closes the material's previous active rate)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@materialId = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-rates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarifa octubre",
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "pricePerKg": 1250.50,
  "validFrom": "2026-10-01",
  "description": "Ajuste por aumento de demanda",
  "status": "active"
}

### MaterialRates — CREATE with a non-positive price (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-rates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarifa inválida",
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "pricePerKg": 0
}

### MaterialRates — CREATE same material and start date (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-rates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarifa repetida",
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "pricePerKg": 1300,
  "validFrom": "2026-10-01"
}
